# Agent install outputs — generated per-user by `hyperresearch install`.
# These files contain absolute paths resolved to the installing user's
# Python environment. NEVER commit them. The authoritative versions live
# in src/hyperresearch/skills/ (skills) and src/hyperresearch/core/hooks.py
# (agent templates).
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md

# ...except the repo's own CLAUDE.md, which is hand-written guidance for
# Claude Code sessions working ON hyperresearch (not a generated install
# output). If you run `hyperresearch install .` inside this checkout, it
# injects a <!-- hyperresearch:start --> block carrying an absolute path
# to your hpr executable — don't stage that block.
!/CLAUDE.md

